Ojos de vidrio Luz de gas Dame un poco Un poco más Tensión alta Cuerda rota Tu energía Se agota Sangre y aceite Bebiendo todo
(Glass eyes Gaslight Give me a little A little more High tension Broken string Your energy Runs out Blood and oil Mix it up Drinking it all From the cup)

00:01:56.600 --> 00:02:22.000
Baila la máquina Cables eléctricos
(The machine dances Hold me tight Electrical cables In the night Don't lose the rhythm Don't lose the rhythm)

00:02:45.300 --> 00:02:48.500
